data: {"delta":"Joseph Vijay, also known as C. Joseph Vijay, is the current Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu [3, 6]. He was sworn in on May 9, 2026, becoming the first Christian chief minister of the state [3, 6]. Vijay is a former actor who transitioned to politics, leading the TVK Party to victory in the state elections [5, 6].","conversationId":"cmvomqb62000jtptust9jvgh2"}

